{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0222_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0a563e3623229ab7a985a69a380c27607a8552e23fdada5713ba2801db2033ea", "ja": "なるほど……。未来、言いにくいんだけど、\nたぶんそれ、夕ご飯を……。", "zh": "原来如此……未来，虽然这话有点难说，\n但你晚饭大概……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
